bug_report:
((cast)cmp) - 1 should be tranformed into -(cast)cmp` where cmp` is the inverse of cmp
Take:
```
int f1(int a, int t)
{
  auto _6 = a == 115;
  auto _7 = (signed int) _6;
  return _6 - 1;
}
```
This should be the same as:
```
int f2(int a, int t)
{
  auto _6 = a != 115;
  auto _7 = (signed int) _6;
  return -_6;
}
```
